                "text": "Use Euler's formula: $e^{j\\theta}=\\cos\\theta+j\\sin\\theta$. With $\\theta=5\\pi/6$, the coordinates are $\\left(\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{6},\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)$.",
